#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:5
#: 81f3cf5126c44cfda9aebb760ea46fdc
msgid "AmovLab P200"
msgstr "AmovLab P200"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:9
#: 2a19bf1e9efc4ea5a0ee34af75cc9e60
msgid ""
"The AmovLab P200 is an almost-ready-to-fly quadcopter designed for education"
" and research users especially those who wish to mount a companion computer "
"like the :ref:`NVidia TX2 <dev:companion-computer-nvidia-tx2>`"
msgstr ""
"AmovLab P200是一款准即飞四旋翼飞行器，专为教育和科研用户设计，尤其适合希望安装 :ref:`NVidia TX2 "
"<dev:companion-computer-nvidia-tx2>` 等伴飞计算机的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:12
#: 9848c6ab75444c6f8cfe6f29365f1208
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:14
#: e626948a512e472f929731fd5b1f0107
msgid ""
"The frame will be available for purchase from late 2019 onwards from many "
"`Hex retailers <http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__"
msgstr "该机架将于2019年底起通过众多 `Hex经销商 <http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__ 销售"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:15
#: 5c7f05a7cf6c422e8e58db7351b73fee
msgid "3300mAh to 5300mAh 3S battery"
msgstr "3300mAh至5300mAh 3S电池"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:16
#: 346020a424214dc1bcaa414b63d46c1b
msgid "RC transmitter with at least 6 channels like the Futaba T10J"
msgstr "至少6通道的RC遥控器，如Futaba T10J"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:19
#: 3c7e4543b7c9459ca984c0374e48d423
msgid "Connection and Setup"
msgstr "连接与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:21
#: c002b961469e4c72bc07144a19309ec9
msgid ""
"Mount the RC receiver to the frame and connect to the autopilot's \"RC IN\" "
"port.  Note that the white wire should be at the bottom"
msgstr "将RC接收机安装到机架上，并连接到飞控的\"RC IN\"端口。注意白线应朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:23
#: fa37ef48cfcb40c7959c8ce5b67b2f48
msgid "Firmware used: Copter-4.0"
msgstr "使用固件版本：Copter-4.0"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:25
#: 0cf75887515c42d58c2bda3c5ce04ef5
msgid ""
"Parameter file: `amovlab-p200.param "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/amovlab-p200.param>`__"
msgstr ""
"参数文件：`amovlab-p200.param "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/amovlab-p200.param>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:27
#: c95232f2637b4c5ab5041728ef1fd8d6
msgid ""
"This parameter file can also be loaded using the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page by selecting \"amovlab-p200\" from"
" the drop down on the middle right and then push the \"Load Presaved\" "
"button."
msgstr ""
"该参数文件也可通过 Mission Planner 的Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter "
"Tree页面加载，在右侧中部下拉菜单中选择\"amovlab-p200\"，然后点击\"Load Presaved\"按钮。"
